% P99 probe 3: is a partial list procedure (no clause for []) accepted,
% failing at runtime on [], as in Prolog?  Or does input coverage demand
% totality outside channel consumption?

CList ::= [] ; [Constant | CList].

exported procedure last(CList?, Constant).
last([X], X?).
last([_|Xs], R?) :- otherwise | last(Xs?, R).
